Test Set 1: Make a Rental
Unit Test: 
  Vehicle isAvailable(start: Date, end: Date): Boolean
    Vehicle v
    v.vehicleID = "V100"
    v.locationID = "L1"
    v.status = AVAILABLE
    
    If (v.isAvailable(Oct 25, 2026, Oct 27, 2026) == true)
           Return PASS
    Else
           Return FAIL

Integration Test: 
  Location getAvailableVehicles(start: Date, end: Date): List<Vehicle>
    Location loc
    loc.locationID = "L1"
    
    Vehicle v1
    v1.locationID = "L1"
    v1.status = AVAILABLE
    
    Vehicle v2
    v2.locationID = "L1"
    v2.status = MAINTENANCE
    
    List<Vehicle> result = loc.getAvailableVehicles(Oct 25, 2026, Oct 27, 2026)
    
    If (result contains v1 AND result does not contain v2)
           Return PASS
    Else
           Return FAIL

System Test
    A customer opens the BeAvis app and logs in. They allow location access and select the closest 
  BeAvis location from the search results. They choose a Toyota Camry for October 25 to October 27, 
  2026, at $45 per day. The app shows a total of $135 for 3 days. They select their saved payment 
  method and confirm. The reservation appears in their account with status PENDING until the 
  contract is signed. 








